    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d309">

                <pb facs="0557" n="529" xml:id="pg529"/>

                <head>309. Telegram From the Department of State to the
                        Embassy in Indonesia<anchor n="1" xml:id="d309-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1957-12-05T19:05:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 5,
                                1957—7:05 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>1226. For Ambassador only from Cumming.
                    We have irrefutable evidence that despite official statements to contrary
                    responsible Indo authorities including highest military authority have ordered
                    subordinate commands throughout Republic to assist West Irian Liberation
                    Committee in taking over Dutch firms and facilities.</p>
                <p>Foregoing highly sensitive info is for your guidance only and should not be used
                    operationally in any way.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold"
                            >Dulles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
